<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 5,900.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 5,900.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.01 vs   0.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.14 vs   0.40 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.01 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Sales		    6.73 vs   6.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.59 vs   2.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.02 vs   3.22</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.00 vs   5.39</p>
<p> Sales		   57.30 vs  53.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
